<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<section class="card">
  <h2>📥 Excel se bill import karein</h2>
  <p class="muted">Client ki Excel (.xlsx) ya CSV file upload karein — saari lines bill mein khud aa jayengi. Upload ke baad pehle <strong>preview</strong> nazar ayega, check karke Save dabayein ge to bill banega.</p>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <label>Bill type
      <select id="impType">
        <option value="aggregate" selected>Aggregate (CFT)</option>
        <option value="water">Sweet water (gallons)</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label>Excel / CSV file
      <input type="file" id="impFile" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv">
    </label>
  </div>
  <p class="muted small">
    File mein <strong>kai sheets</strong> hon to har sheet ka <strong>alag bill</strong> preview banega — tables aur data apni apni jagah rahenge, mix nahi honge.
    Bill No, Project, PO No aur billing period sheet se khud parh liye jayenge.<br>
    Columns ke naam pehchane jate hain (Date, Vehicle No, DC No, Description, Trips, Gln/Quantity, Rate) — tartib jo bhi ho, header jahan bhi ho.
    Quantity khaali ho to vehicle ki capacity khud lag jayegi, Rate khaali ho to material ka rate khud lag jayega.<br>
    Sample templates:
    <a href="/bills/import/template?type=aggregate">Aggregate template (CSV)</a> ·
    <a href="/bills/import/template?type=water">Sweet water template (CSV)</a>
  </p>
  <p id="impMsg" class="flash flash-error" style="display:none"></p>
  <hr style="margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb">
  <h3>📋 Ya Excel se copy-paste kar dein</h3>
  <p class="muted">File banane ki bhi zaroorat nahi — Excel ya Google Sheets mein apni lines select karke <strong>Copy</strong> karein, yahan box mein <strong>Paste</strong> kar dein, lines khud ban jayengi.</p>
  <label style="display:block">Yahan paste karein
    <textarea id="impPaste" rows="7" style="width:100%" placeholder="Date	Vehicle No	DC No	Description	Trips	Quantity	Rate&#10;2026-09-01	TAM-143	101	Coarse Aggregate	2	850	57.79"></textarea>
  </label>
  <button type="button" id="impPasteBtn" class="btn btn-gold btn-block" style="margin-top:10px">Paste se preview dekhein</button>
</section>

<div id="impPreviews"></div>

<script>
  window.IMP_VEHICLES = <%- JSON.stringify(vehicles.map(v => ({ regNo: v.regNo, capacity: v.capacity }))) %>;
  window.IMP_MATERIALS = <%- JSON.stringify(materials.map(m => ({ name: m.name, rate: m.rate, unit: m.unit }))) %>;
  window.IMP_CUSTOMERS = <%- JSON.stringify(customers.map(c => ({ name: c.name, project: c.project || '' }))) %>;
  window.IMP_WATER_RATE = <%= waterRate %>;
  window.IMP_TODAY = <%- JSON.stringify(today) %>;
</script>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/xlsx/0.18.5/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
<script src="/js/import.js"></script>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
